  "download_disabled": false,
  "description": "<p>This is the LakeATLAS dataset, version 1.0, which is fully described in Lehner et al. 2022 (see DOI-link in References below).</p>\n<p><br>\n<strong>In this Figshare repository, there are 2 zipped data files (each >1.5 GB in size) containing all global data in 2 formats:</strong></p>\n<p>1. LakeATLAS_Data_v10.gdb.zip (lake polygons and outlet points, in geodatabase format)<br>\n2. LakeATLAS_Data_v10_shp.zip (lake polygons and outlet points, in shapefile format)<br>\n</p>\n<p><strong>There are also 2 PDF  files that provide technical specifications:</strong></p>\n<p>1. HydroATLAS_TechDoc_v10_1.pdf (technical documentation of the overarching HydroATLAS database which includes LakeATLAS)<br>\n2. LakeATLAS_Catalog_v10.pdf (catalog file listing all lake attributes)</p>",
